o;s 8 grids in Rusk County shows October to November under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, Sep-Oct came in at 57% of normal and Nov-Dec at 52%, after May to June ran 176%. So far in 2026, January to February and February to March both came in at 58% of normal. Grid 14542 had its driest year in 1963 at 54%.</p>"}
